<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Mazda Cambodia | Strategic Turnaround Proposal</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jost:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Roboto+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap">
<style>
:root {
  --crimson: #A6192E;
  --crimson-lift: #D31D38;
  --crimson-soft: #FDF2F4;
  --safety-navy: #061A29;
  --safety-blue: #0F4C75;
  --safety-accent: #0088CC;
  --safety-soft: #E8F4FA;
  --dark: #0D0D0D;
  --dark-surface: #181818;
  --surface: #FFFFFF;
  --surface-alt: #F4F2F0;
  --border: #D2CBC7;
  --border-strong: #9E9590;
  --text-main: #141211;
  --text-muted: #57514E;
  --f-display: "Jost", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
  --f-body: "Instrument Sans", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
  --f-mono: "Roboto Mono", monospace;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body { background: var(--surface-alt); color: var(--text-main); font-family: var(--f-body); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }

/* Sticky Header */
header.site-header {
  position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 1000;
  background: var(--dark); color: #fff;
  border-bottom: 4px solid var(--crimson);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
}
.header-inner {
  max-width: 1160px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  height: 72px;
}
.brand-wordmark {
  font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.28em;
  text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; text-decoration: none;
}
.brand-wordmark span {
  color: var(--crimson-lift); font-family: var(--f-mono);
  font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; margin-left: 8px; font-weight: 600;
}
nav.main-nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
nav.main-nav a {
  color: #CCC; text-decoration: none; font-family: var(--f-display);
  font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.2s ease;
}
nav.main-nav a:hover, nav.main-nav a.active { background: var(--crimson); color: #fff; }
nav.main-nav a.nav-safety { background: var(--safety-accent); color: #fff; }
nav.main-nav a.nav-safety:hover { background: #0070A8; }

/* Container */
.container { max-width: 1160px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 36px 24px 100px; }

/* Hero */
.hero-banner {
  background: var(--dark); color: #fff; padding: 56px 44px;
  border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 48px; border-top: 6px solid var(--crimson);
}
.hero-eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: var(--crimson-lift); margin-bottom: 16px; display: block; font-weight: 700;
}
.hero-banner h1 {
  font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: clamp(34px, 5.2vw, 56px);
  font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.05; margin-bottom: 20px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}
.hero-banner h1 strong { font-weight: 800; color: var(--crimson-lift); }
.hero-lead { font-size: 19px; color: #D7D2CF; max-width: 76ch; margin-bottom: 32px; line-height: 1.55; }
.hero-pill-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
.hero-pill { background: var(--dark-surface); border: 1px solid #333; padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 5px solid var(--crimson); }
.hero-pill.safety-pill { border-left-color: var(--safety-accent); }
.hero-pill .title { font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 11.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9E9793; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 6px; font-weight: 600; }
.hero-pill .val { font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }

/* Base Section */
section.block {
  background: var(--surface); border: 2px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 8px; padding: 50px 44px; margin-bottom: 48px;
}

/* Big Section Headers */
.section-header-wrap {
  border-bottom: 3px solid var(--dark);
  padding-bottom: 24px; margin-bottom: 36px;
}
.section-badge-row {
  display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.massive-number {
  font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 78px);
  font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--crimson);
}
.massive-number.safety-num { color: var(--safety-blue); }
.section-tag {
  font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: var(--crimson);
}
.section-tag.safety-tag { color: var(--safety-blue); }
.section-title {
  font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
  font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.03em; line-height: 1.12; margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.section-subtitle { font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 84ch; line-height: 1.5; }

/* Sub Headings */
.sub-heading {
  font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; margin: 38px 0 18px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
}
.sub-heading::before {
  content: ""; display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 26px;
  background: var(--crimson); border-radius: 2px;
}
.sub-heading.safety-sub::before { background: var(--safety-accent); }

/* OWN SAFETY FEATURE BLOCK */
section.block-safety-spotlight {
  border: 3px solid var(--safety-blue);
  background: #FFFFFF;
  box-shadow: 0 10px 36px rgba(15, 76, 117, 0.14);
}
.safety-alert-banner {
  background: var(--safety-navy); color: #fff; border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 34px 38px; margin-bottom: 34px; border-left: 10px solid var(--safety-accent);
}
.safety-alert-banner h3 {
  font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #FFF;
}
.safety-alert-banner p { font-size: 17px; color: #D7E7F2; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 82ch; }

.safety-stat-matrix {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
  gap: 18px; margin: 28px 0 36px;
}
.safety-stat-matrix .stat-tile {
  background: var(--safety-soft); border: 2px solid #BFDCEF;
  border-radius: 8px; padding: 26px 22px; text-align: center;
}
.safety-stat-matrix .stat-tile .big-val {
  font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 52px; font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--safety-blue); line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.safety-stat-matrix .stat-tile .stat-name {
  font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--safety-navy); letter-spacing: 0.08em; line-height: 1.4;
}

/* Editorial Quotes */
.editorial-quote {
  background: var(--surface); border: 2px solid var(--border);
  border-left: 8px solid var(--crimson); border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 26px 30px; margin: 22px 0;
}
.editorial-quote.safety-card {
  border-color: #BED8E8; border-left: 8px solid var(--safety-blue);
  background: #F8FBFC;
}
.quote-content {
  font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.45;
  color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 14px; font-weight: 500;
}
.quote-byline {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 10px; font-family: var(--f-mono);
  font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}
.quote-tag { color: var(--crimson); font-weight: 700; }
.editorial-quote.safety-card .quote-tag { color: var(--safety-blue); }

/* Buttons */
.action-toggle {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 18px;
  background: var(--surface-alt); border: 2px solid var(--border-strong);
  color: var(--text-main); font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 15.5px;
  font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  padding: 16px 28px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 24px;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
}
.action-toggle:hover { background: var(--crimson); color: #fff; border-color: var(--crimson); }
.action-toggle.safety-btn:hover { background: var(--safety-blue); border-color: var(--safety-blue); }
.action-toggle .chevron { font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; }
.expandable-panel { display: none; margin-top: 24px; padding: 26px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--surface-alt); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
.expandable-panel.active { display: block; }

/* Timeline List */
.timeline-list { border-left: 4px solid var(--crimson); padding-left: 30px; margin: 24px 0 10px 10px; }
.timeline-item { margin-bottom: 30px; }
.timeline-item h4 { font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.timeline-item p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; }

/* Tiers */
.tier-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(310px, 1fr)); gap: 26px; margin-top: 30px; }
.tier-card {
  border: 2px solid var(--border); background: var(--surface);
  border-radius: 8px; padding: 34px 30px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; position: relative;
}
.tier-card.featured { border-color: var(--crimson); box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(166, 25, 46, 0.14); }
.tier-card.featured::before {
  content: "CURRENT PROPOSAL TIER"; position: absolute; top: -14px; left: 24px;
  background: var(--crimson); color: #fff; font-family: var(--f-mono);
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 4px;
}
.tier-title { font-family: var(--f-display); font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.tier-price { font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 34px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--crimson); margin-bottom: 20px; }
.tier-features { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 30px; flex-grow: 1; }
.tier-features li { font-size: 15px; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--surface-alt); color: #3A3533; }
.tier-features li strong { color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 700; }
.tier-action-button {
  display: block; text-align: center; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px;
  font-family: var(--f-display); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;
  text-decoration: none; font-size: 14.5px; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  border: 2px solid var(--dark); color: var(--dark); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
}
.tier-card.featured .tier-action-button { background: var(--crimson); border-color: var(--crimson); color: #fff; }
.tier-card.featured .tier-action-button:hover { background: var(--crimson-lift); }
.tier-action-button:hover { background: var(--dark); color: #fff; }

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  nav.main-nav { display: none; }
  .hero-banner, section.block { padding: 28px 20px; }
  .quote-byline { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="header-inner">
    <a href="#" class="brand-wordmark">MAZDA<span>CAMBODIA</span></a>
    <nav class="main-nav">
      <a href="#audit">01 &middot; Audit</a>
      <a href="#safety" class="nav-safety">02 &middot; Own Safety</a>
      <a href="#pipeline">03 &middot; The Pipeline</a>
      <a href="#ask">04 &middot; The Ask</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="container">

  <!-- HERO BANNER -->
  <div class="hero-banner">
    <span class="hero-eyebrow">Strategic Growth Plan &middot; 2026 Commercial Turnaround</span>
    <h1>We build Mazda.<br><strong>Let Cambodia know it.</strong></h1>
    <p class="hero-lead">A targeted commercial plan to expand Mazda from 650 units to 908 units. We will activate our Poipet assembly facility, lead the market with our world-leading safety record[cite: 1], and replace used import dependencies with guaranteed residual value structures[cite: 1].</p>
    
    <div class="hero-pill-grid">
      <div class="hero-pill">
        <div class="title">Local Assembly Plant</div>
        <div class="val">$7M Poipet Facility[cite: 1]</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-pill safety-pill">
        <div class="title">Global Safety Rank</div>
        <div class="val">8 IIHS Top Safety Pick+[cite: 1]</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-pill">
        <div class="title">Showroom Network</div>
        <div class="val">Siem Reap in Progress</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SECTION 01: INITIAL MARKETING AUDIT -->
  <section id="audit" class="block">
    <div class="section-header-wrap">
      <div class="section-badge-row">
        <span class="massive-number">01</span>
        <span class="section-tag">Internal Diagnostic &middot; Marketing Audit</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Initial Marketing Audit: Three Operational Flags</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">An audit of 1,672 published posts and brand collateral reveals the operational factors behind Mazda's market absence[cite: 1].</p>
    </div>

    <div class="sub-heading">Identified Channel Failures</div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 18px;">
      <div style="padding: 24px; border: 2px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--surface-alt);">
        <h3 style="font-size: 17px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">1. Inconsistent Brand Standards</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted);">Visual assets use fragmented color schemes, varying fonts, and disjointed retail presentation. This weakens Mazda's Japanese design reputation.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 24px; border: 2px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--surface-alt);">
        <h3 style="font-size: 17px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">2. Complete Silence on Safety</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted);">Despite winning more global safety honors than any competitor, safety is never mentioned on local Cambodian customer channels[cite: 1].</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 24px; border: 2px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--surface-alt);">
        <h3 style="font-size: 17px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">3. Low-Budget, Low-Engagement Posts</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted);">1,672 posts across four years produced an average of only 0.29 reactions per post[cite: 1]. 46% of posts lacked captions or concrete monthly pricing figures[cite: 1].</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="editorial-quote">
      <div class="quote-content">"Safety is that hidden feature that most people do not care about when buying a new car. I own a Mazda CX-30."</div>
      <div class="quote-byline">
        <span>@CaravaggioRoma &middot; Verified Owner</span>
        <span class="quote-tag">Customer Mindset</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <button class="action-toggle" onclick="toggleBlock('audit-detail', this)">
      <span>View Channel Audit Details</span>
      <span class="chevron">&#9660;</span>
    </button>
    <div id="audit-detail" class="expandable-panel">
      <p style="font-size: 15.5px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65;">
        The public channel was silent for 94 consecutive days in 2025 and posted only 11 times in 2026[cite: 1]. The content strategy failed to mention local assembly capabilities or monthly financing[cite: 1]. Rebuilding engagement requires three posts per week, clear Khmer-first text, and transparent financing terms ($492/month for CX-30 entry trim)[cite: 1].
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 02: OWN SAFETY (FEATURED COMMAND BLOCK) -->
  <section id="safety" class="block block-safety-spotlight">
    <div class="section-header-wrap">
      <div class="section-badge-row">
        <span class="massive-number safety-num">02</span>
        <span class="section-tag safety-tag">The Core Platform &middot; Safety Pillar</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="color: var(--safety-navy);">Own Safety: The Unclaimed Market Opportunity</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Cambodia recorded 1,467 road crash fatalities in 2025[cite: 1]. Mazda manufactures the safest production vehicles in this market, yet this structural advantage has never been leveraged in sales[cite: 1].</p>
    </div>

    <div class="safety-alert-banner">
      <h3>Verified Safety Performance &amp; Engineering</h3>
      <p>
        Mazda holds 8 IIHS Top Safety Pick+ awards in 2026, leading the worldwide automotive industry[cite: 1]. In Euro NCAP crash evaluations, the CX-30 recorded an unprecedented 99% Adult Occupant Protection score. Structural integrity is built on patented 1,800 MPa ultra-high tensile steel developed alongside Sumitomo Metal Industries.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="safety-stat-matrix">
      <div class="stat-tile">
        <div class="big-val">8</div>
        <div class="stat-name">2026 IIHS Top Safety Pick+ Awards[cite: 1]</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-tile">
        <div class="big-val">99%</div>
        <div class="stat-name">Euro NCAP Adult Occupancy Score</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-tile">
        <div class="big-val">1,800</div>
        <div class="stat-name">MPa High-Tensile Sumitomo Steel</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sub-heading safety-sub" style="color: var(--safety-navy);">Customer Survival Testimonials &amp; Independent Expert Reviews</div>

    <div class="editorial-quote safety-card">
      <div class="quote-content">"This car saved my life in highway at 105km wow i love mazda"</div>
      <div class="quote-byline">
        <span>@simonegalvani1602 &middot; Highway Incident Survivor</span>
        <span class="quote-tag">Real World Protection</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="editorial-quote safety-card">
      <div class="quote-content">"In the event of an accident, there are few safer places to be than the front seats of the Mazda CX-30."</div>
      <div class="quote-byline">
        <span>Matthew Avery &middot; Director of Insurance Research, Thatcham Research</span>
        <span class="quote-tag">Independent Test Verification</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="editorial-quote safety-card">
      <div class="quote-content">"1. Military Tank, 2. CX-30. Its build qualities justify the price tag. Good work Mazda."</div>
      <div class="quote-byline">
        <span>@KallandraYT &amp; @vivaselementum &middot; Community Crash Review</span>
        <span class="quote-tag">Structural Integrity</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="editorial-quote safety-card">
      <div class="quote-content">"Part of the new R&amp;D was injected into new metallurgy techniques. They teamed up with Sumitomo Metal Industries and created a world first, 1,800 MPa Ultra-High Tensile Steel."</div>
      <div class="quote-byline">
        <span>@inodesnet &middot; Technical Metallurgy Review</span>
        <span class="quote-tag">Proprietary Metallurgy</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <button class="action-toggle safety-btn" onclick="toggleBlock('safety-detail', this)">
      <span>View Safety Campaign Execution Details</span>
      <span class="chevron">&#9660;</span>
    </button>
    <div id="safety-detail" class="expandable-panel">
      <p style="font-size: 15.5px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65;">
        The commercial safety platform launches during the high-traffic Khmer New Year travel window[cite: 1]. We will conduct free 20-point safety inspections for all brands across provincial stops[cite: 1], release crash test telemetry translated into Khmer, and partner directly with national road transport authorities on family safety education[cite: 1].
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 03: THE USED IMPORT PIPELINE -->
  <section id="pipeline" class="block">
    <div class="section-header-wrap">
      <div class="section-badge-row">
        <span class="massive-number">03</span>
        <span class="section-tag">Dominance Architecture &middot; Market Analysis</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title">The Used Import Pipeline: Why Toyota &amp; Ford Dominate</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">How thirty years of salvaged vehicle imports created competitor market share, and how Mazda systematically dismantles it[cite: 1].</p>
    </div>

    <div class="sub-heading">Three Decades of Fleet Conditioning</div>

    <div class="timeline-list">
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <h4>1. The Thirty-Year Used Fleet Inflow</h4>
        <p>Between 1993 and 2018, over 80% of vehicle imports were used US auction inventory, dominated by Camrys, Corollas, and Priuses. This formed a vast national fleet where roadside mechanics in every province learned to service Toyota systems using widely available scrap parts[cite: 1].</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <h4>2. The Resulting Resale Liquidity Belief</h4>
        <p>Because roadside repair was universally available, buyers treated used Toyotas as cash-equivalent assets that could be resold within 48 hours[cite: 1]. Toyota's dominance in new car showrooms is the direct result of this used fleet familiarity rather than modern vehicle design[cite: 1].</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item">
        <h4>3. The Mazda Turnaround Strategy</h4>
        <p>Mazda cannot replicate thirty years of grey-market imports overnight. Instead, we remove customer hesitation with written 36-month Guaranteed Buy-Back Certificates in Khmer[cite: 1]. We support this with 25 certified independent repair shops via the Automotive Centre of Excellence Cambodia (ACE-C), alongside trade-in incentives for older Toyotas[cite: 1].</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <button class="action-toggle" onclick="toggleBlock('pipeline-detail', this)">
      <span>View Certified Repairer Network Details</span>
      <span class="chevron">&#9660;</span>
    </button>
    <div id="pipeline-detail" class="expandable-panel">
      <p style="font-size: 15.5px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65;">
        Partnering with ACE-C allows Mazda to train and certify 25 independent provincial workshops during year one[cite: 1]. We supply diagnostic units, maintain genuine parts lines, and install official exterior signage[cite: 1]. This matches competitor service accessibility without the capital expense of full franchise showrooms[cite: 1].
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 04: THE ASK -->
  <section id="ask" class="block">
    <div class="section-header-wrap">
      <div class="section-badge-row">
        <span class="massive-number">04</span>
